  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIHR-funded scholarships for 15th World Conference on Injury Prevention and Safety Promotion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIHR funded scholarships to support the attendance of researchers from ODA-eligible countries to attend and participate in the 15th World Conference on Injury Prevention and Safety Promotion (Safety 2024). The conference, which NIHR representatives attended, presented an opportunity for researchers to network and present their research proposals and findings to a global audience of funders, policymakers and civil society representatives. The scholarships were available only to participants presenting at the conference (oral/poster/workshop).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity has 2 objectives:

1. To enable researchers from ODA-eligible countries to attend Safety 2024, to maximise networking and knowledge exchange opportunities for those individuals.

2. To increase attendance from researchers in ODA-eligible countries, to bring diverse views and ideas to the conference.</narrative>
  </description>
